{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026sBxqWcQrkQ1795299402.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>天氣概況：一股清勁至強風程度的偏東氣流正影響廣東沿岸。</p><p></p><p>本港地區今日天氣預測：大致多雲。稍後有一兩陣微雨。氣溫徘徊在23度左右。吹和緩至清勁偏東風，離岸及高地間中吹強風。</p><p></p><p>展望：星期一多雲，初時風勢仍然頗大。本週中期轉吹偏北風，天氣轉涼及有幾陣雨。</p><p></p><p>05:45 更新</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T23:19:54.995919+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T22:15:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T22:57:33.060838+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T23:13:15.099684+00:00","content_hash":"fc0885226bacd354af7acd52800860db6c8555c755cac62d71fa7225c9de3f38","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-21T23:19:54.995919+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}